SUMMARY:State of AI (Online)
DESCRIPTION:Modern Web (Triangle)\nAI initiatives stall when there are no 
 trusted internal champions to carry them forward.\n\n​In this State of A
 I Leadership session\, we’ll explore how organizations can intentionally
  develop AI champions when none exist organically. We’ll discuss why AI 
 efforts lose momentum without credible advocates\, how to grow champions f
 rom ICs\, tech leads\, and engineering managers\, what enablement and ince
 ntives actually work\, and what to avoid.\n\nFeaturing\n[Thor Schaeff](htt
 ps://www.linkedin.com/in/thorwebdev/)\, Developer Experience\, Google Deep
 mind\n[Matt Rubens](https://www.linkedin.com/in/mattrubens/)\, CEO\, Roomo
 te\n[Rob Ocel](https://www.linkedin.com/in/robocel/)\, VP of Innovation\, 
 This Dot Labs\n[Elliott Fouts](https://www.linkedin.com/in/elliott-fouts/)
 \, Elliott Fouts\, This Dot Labs
